  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 200eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>Don’t forget to wrap your tools. It’ll protect you when you need it most, not to mention the improved grip and comfort it can provide.</em></p>\n<p>Only one Rubber Grip may be installed. When firing the weapon at a target within 50m/yds, the total penalty (if any) applied to the user’s Attack Check is reduced by 1 (i.e., an Armor Penalty of -1 to REF while suffering the Damaged Eye Critical Injury [-2 to Ranged Attacks] results in a total -3 Penalty, which is reduced to -2). This attachment does not function while the weapon is installed into Cyberware, Cyberware equivalent gear (e.g., Battlegloves), or Vehicle Heavy Weapon Mounts.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to Gabo Shadowbane in the R. Talsorian Games Discord for the basis of this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Against targets within 50m/yds, your total attack penalty is reduced by 1; toggle the situational +1 when you have a penalty to reduce.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Grips &amp; Controls).</em></p>"
